  "body": "Imagine starting your day by watching the sunrise over Orewa Beach, walking along the beach, grabbing a coffee in the village, and having it all just moments from home.\r\n\r\nPositioned directly across the road from the beach, this spacious ground floor apartment combines an enviable coastal location with approximately 140m² of easy care living.\r\n\r\nOffering two bedrooms and two bathrooms, there’s a wonderful sense of space here that sets it apart from many apartment options. Sea views provide a constant reminder of just how close you are to the water, while the ground-floor position makes everyday living wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nSet within a well maintained, solid concrete building of just 15 apartments, this is a small and tightly held complex. Two car parks add another valuable advantage, although with Orewa’s cafés, restaurants, shops and beautiful beachfront all within easy walking distance, you may find yourself leaving the cars at home.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to downsize without giving up space, secure an easy lock-up-and-leave, or simply embrace the Orewa beach lifestyle, this is an opportunity that deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nHighlights include:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 140m² of spacious living\r\n• Ground-floor position\r\n• Sea views\r\n• Orewa Beach directly across the road\r\n• Two bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n• Two car parks\r\n• Solid concrete construction\r\n• Boutique complex of just 15 apartments\r\n• Easy walk to Orewa cafés, restaurants and shops\r\n• Low maintenance coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe beach is across the road, the village is an easy stroll away, and the Orewa lifestyle is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
